{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:834f107d8bf17fa9ae567145ac72e1ea65bb5f13d7bb9b81feefbf21a99763a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bbc506c58a502334289a6fcede9480a28d245ac27a4c90ff79d15ea02eed950",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，晚上好。\n今天的商讨，辛苦您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce6a946b6203d059a53f6f5ee354905988bb7ff65a8a2b502caae280708a7d64",
      "text": "我刚才正在确认\n收到的主题曲歌词……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6af7e331551fdb35d667146fd27699f3c7f235821dfe90896158ca7b0f5067e7",
      "text": "这里的“Trick”部分。似乎是滑板的\n专业术语，意思是“技巧”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:936aea4c990b592007fad1e7ac1910e9cd12fe3b1f70860a9bb9c6c0433a3726",
      "text": "像这种疑似专业术语的词汇，\n在歌词中点缀了好几处。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374307b1149bdaa58e0180c0261c37093d3cfdf87e5041657e8d513870262a83",
      "text": "对我而言全都很陌生。虽然我也试着自己\n查了查，但并没有自信能完全理解透彻……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fba021cba366c0ba5a051d9f0dd0b241a526ac2809f3df71cabe36a71c4548bb",
      "text": "这样下去，恐怕无法将主题曲中蕴含的情感\n准确传达给各位观众。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3fc8aa8ca9086c1c047abaac4d222da9b27db6c02c4da70bcfe02cc255963e2",
      "text": "因此，如果制作人方便的话……能稍微\n帮我一起查查词义吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c85f787b05921f36383898f8dff412e8c096e9e28235f38483c352ad1edd091c",
      "text": "当然可以！\n一起查吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5297d690cafa5c572be7f91cc447b0d68d69b33ad96f0795a25f0baeb28f2593",
      "text": "包在我身上！\n我来整理术语",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0224e3b32a29f7e6fbc19d27db6ed47b99eead61b3eb5a55a537004fc32a7a02",
      "text": "非常感谢！如果有制作人\n施以援手，我的不安应该也能消除了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0270f3f433b5827b46d38a783f0869e5e451963820cee2d2a0f45f04e5bcc1fa",
      "text": "我也会尽可能自己去查术语，争取在录音前\n把歌词彻底研读透彻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_403_2_4_019_03_09_b:2_4_019_03_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ab5a65eddf1f6530389126d80f465bae84b2967e301cb3f2a3839df671d20bc",
      "text": "突然致电，失礼了。\n那么，之后也请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
